'''Squire''' is a [[Rare Weapons|rare]] knife that is obtainable by unboxing it from [[Knife Box 4]] or through trading.

==Appearance==
The whole knife is nearly solid black, but imprinted on the blade are some dark gray and brown vintage details. The handle also has some light gray scratch marks imprinted on it.

==Trivia ==
*Its model, published by [[Nikilis]], can be found [http://www.roblox.com/Squire-item?id=315501560 here].

